<h1 local-id=3D"0ab7d75942ca" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-CoreEntityDes=
ign">Core Entity Design</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"5ef8ca5fe5b5" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-1.ALERTItem">=
1. ALERT Item</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PK =3D =
ALERT#&lt;AlertID&gt;
SK =3D METADATA
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"7fce60e9faa8" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Example">Exam=
ple</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "PK": "ALERT#A-101",
  "SK": "METADATA",

  "OrgID": "ORG#1",
  "PatientID": "PAT#123",

  "AlertState": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "Priority": "P0",

  "InputType": "THRESHOLD_BREACH",
  "TriggerTimestamp": "2026-04-17T10:00:00Z",

  "AssignedToUserID": "USER#ASHA",
  "AssignedAt": "2026-04-17T10:02:00Z",

  "GroupingKey": "PAT#123|BP|CRITICAL",

  "SLADueAt": "2026-04-17T10:15:00Z",
  "SLABreached": false,

  "TriggerSummary": "Systolic BP crossed Critical threshold",

  "EvidencePayload": { ... }
}
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"43340f1e960a" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-2.ACTIVITY(Au=
ditTrail)">2. ACTIVITY (Audit Trail)</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PK =3D =
ALERT#&lt;AlertID&gt;
SK =3D ACTIVITY#&lt;Timestamp&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"9795c46cba78" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Example.1">Ex=
ample</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "PK": "ALERT#A-101",
  "SK": "ACTIVITY#2026-04-17T10:02:00Z",

  "ActivityType": "ASSIGNED",
  "PerformedBy": "USER#ASHA",
  "Comment": "Assigned to self"
}
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"06d4cd1644b5"><strong>One query =E2=86=92 full alert + histo=
ry</strong></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"b81cb036cd81" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-3.GROUP(Optim=
izationEntity)">3. GROUP (Optimization Entity)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"da2cdc4bf525">This avoids recalculating group summary every =
time</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PK =3D =
GROUP#&lt;GroupingKey&gt;
SK =3D METADATA
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"73a0d8183a39" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Example.2">Ex=
ample</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "PK": "GROUP#PAT#123|BP|CRITICAL",
  "SK": "METADATA",

  "PatientID": "PAT#123",
  "OpenCount": 5,
  "HighestPriority": "P0",

  "AssignedToUserID": "USER#ASHA",
  "LatestAlertTimestamp": "2026-04-17T10:05:00Z",

  "BreachedCount": 1
}
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"ccf1cbc62e23" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-4.EVENT(Idemp=
otency)">4. EVENT (Idempotency)</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PK =3D =
EVENT#&lt;InputEventID&gt;
SK =3D METADATA
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"4357294499ce">Prevent duplicate alert creation</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"6d3d1f8b21de" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GlobalSeconda=
ryIndexes(GSIs)">Global Secondary Indexes (GSIs)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"983b8d66639e">This is where enterprise-level thinking matter=
s.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"39b8a0a47fec" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GSI-1:TeamQue=
ue(OrgLevel)">GSI-1: Team Queue (Org Level)</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI1PK =
=3D ORG#&lt;OrgID&gt;
GSI1SK =3D STATE#&lt;AlertState&gt;#PRIORITY#&lt;Priority&gt;#TS#&lt;Timest=
amp&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"d1323154d503" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Supports:">Su=
pports:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"787c6bb4-94d5-44ab-9a4b-d05f8beeb53d">
<li local-id=3D"9cd64195-0fc9-42a1-99b5-b5dec2b1490b">
<p local-id=3D"c7819502c863">Team Queue</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21287475-6aa1-4c48-8ac2-4b7665372680">
<p local-id=3D"72ac813598be">Filter by state</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ecc35654-8f5b-4ece-ad1b-b5af5ad10366">
<p local-id=3D"00eca3d26cc0">Sort by priority + time</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"651a815e90e5" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GSI-2:MyQueue=
(UserLevel)">GSI-2: My Queue (User Level)</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI2PK =
=3D USER#&lt;AssignedToUserID&gt;
GSI2SK =3D STATE#&lt;AlertState&gt;#TS#&lt;Timestamp&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"d089139fcdef" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Supports:.1">=
Supports:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"fcfd06bf-d1a2-4db5-9ca2-85f9f4328db7">
<li local-id=3D"7f09a796-cd0a-401c-a825-35f5c49af44e">
<p local-id=3D"fba9b61e3200">My alerts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0de14fa7-e039-451d-b91c-84770b50444d">
<p local-id=3D"31947b961a33">User workload</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"75cd8fb4-0fd7-4271-878a-e8f72f768aab">
<p local-id=3D"c221703c0e49">SLA tracking</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"80f445282ed7" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GSI-3:Patient=
View">GSI-3: Patient View</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI3PK =
=3D PAT#&lt;PatientID&gt;
GSI3SK =3D TS#&lt;TriggerTimestamp&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"17fb2b7f28d0" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Supports:.2">=
Supports:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"28c9a51d-9b4e-4176-844d-d4fd4e9baeae">
<li local-id=3D"3d03e792-8fb8-4e4f-83c3-b8833d25d716">
<p local-id=3D"5147e582be27">Patient alert history</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f480c95b-6e95-48e1-b714-d5654928fb46">
<p local-id=3D"734e5b493e6b">Doctor dashboard</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"f05cee0e9619" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GSI-4:Groupin=
g">GSI-4: Grouping</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI4PK =
=3D GROUP#&lt;GroupingKey&gt;
GSI4SK =3D TS#&lt;TriggerTimestamp&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"c4ff971a8176" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Supports:.3">=
Supports:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d1bd36e5-3786-4667-a916-0bea471ffdc4">
<li local-id=3D"6ede389f-7291-4227-ad98-044bf4dc3374">
<p local-id=3D"d85c6843bd7e">Fetch alerts in group</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"544bbe74-0fc3-4009-9275-33c22706a95f">
<p local-id=3D"5cc7f95bc743">Group drill-down</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"1b0eb0154513" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GSI-5:SLATrac=
king">GSI-5: SLA Tracking</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI5PK =
=3D SLA#&lt;DateBucket&gt;
GSI5SK =3D TS#&lt;SLADueAt&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"7f2d1b7d108e">DateBucket =3D <code>2026-04-17</code></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"b5f62857048d" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Supports:.4">=
Supports:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"61ab2e25-c71a-4762-872f-d1e06e0d2ce4">
<li local-id=3D"62bd4677-14df-41c8-9d15-704bab84121d">
<p local-id=3D"c9b514115dfb">SLA monitoring dashboards</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"31b2cee6-8db6-43d6-b98c-45ac916c59ae">
<p local-id=3D"dc6c1ee08bdf">Breach detection jobs</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"b270573946e2" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-QueryOptimiza=
tion">Query Optimization</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"887861c64d2c" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-AlertDetailPa=
ge">Alert Detail Page</h2>
<p local-id=3D"13d103cc42f2"><strong>1 Query</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PK =3D =
ALERT#A-101
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"fa60d74d5edc">Returns:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"48cac568-989c-4140-ab18-90470b166f59">
<li local-id=3D"c22b3f3e-02fe-40c4-9c29-4567c7dd6f68">
<p local-id=3D"8717e344d3df">Alert metadata</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ece19d40-5b75-47ec-9c1a-95a8f0a3e21c">
<p local-id=3D"b657bd790028">All activity (sorted)</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"f40c9aad6b04" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-TeamQueue">Te=
am Queue</h2>
<p local-id=3D"b2679c06aa27"><strong>1 Query</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI1PK =
=3D ORG#1
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"1f4c2ae1d7a2" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-MyQueue">My Q=
ueue</h2>
<p local-id=3D"3f749732e5c6"><strong>1 Query</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">GSI2PK =
=3D USER#ASHA
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"f9e1b451cc47" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-GroupView">Gr=
oup View</h2>
<p local-id=3D"0d3eadfbc417"><strong>2 Queries max</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8f5b60ef-9c34-4f13-a675-388f34dfeaea">
<li local-id=3D"9744b14c-7a69-446d-9bd8-c280e7ecf549">
<p local-id=3D"750ad40254e2">GROUP metadata</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b2e59f7-24bb-4f24-9e7d-aaa541c45a75">
<p local-id=3D"490318f576bb">Alerts in group (GSI4)</p></li>
</ol>
<h1 local-id=3D"fb931d161836" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-CostOptimizat=
ionStrategies">Cost Optimization Strategies</h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"86eaf963e2db" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-1.AvoidFan-ou=
tQueries">1. Avoid Fan-out Queries</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"423104ea-9995-4d2c-a9ab-33e160be6111">
<li local-id=3D"4777afa2-0ee2-4437-ae88-2dc7f7d42b93">
<p local-id=3D"bb5b4d763b02">Everything queryable via PK or GSI</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"72b53146-bf2a-4a03-8a57-f2b6161a3032">
<p local-id=3D"de61599179c0">No scans</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"d6acf445c333" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-2.MinimizeWri=
tes">2. Minimize Writes</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"9accae4a-2489-4e4c-b095-83a7d0c15b99">
<li local-id=3D"8069ed39-a1c4-4db9-a8bc-7d3336804124">
<p local-id=3D"c216f99d8b75">Only:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d99a7484-cd13-49bb-b36f-2488801b717b">
<li local-id=3D"3e476c3e-9305-4f7f-aa63-de533627ea38">
<p local-id=3D"a445d5dbb04b">1 Alert write</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8d438014-1084-4e03-839d-8490e842eb9a">
<p local-id=3D"b649cd1147f2">1 Activity write per action</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"790ae122-b4a7-45d9-9eef-eee439daf7a1">
<p local-id=3D"5ddd1f1aaa53">Group updates are lightweight</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"93f37d43a8be" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-3.AvoidLargeI=
tems">3. Avoid Large Items</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d5546a88-a68a-4330-8a8c-4d2dcff727b3">
<li local-id=3D"3cde1d5e-b98c-4915-ad74-92ed21f690ba">
<p local-id=3D"d2f55186bcc0">Keep <code>EvidencePayload</code> trimmed</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"a74ca8c9-81f1-4554-b419-bc258a9f6c43">
<p local-id=3D"24af43fe6e21">Store large payloads in S3 if needed</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c682118688fa" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-4.UseTTL">4. =
Use TTL</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">"TTL": =
1735689600
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"5b1b0264edf2">Auto-delete old closed alerts</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"40417d5d73e8" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-HighThroughpu=
tWrites">High Throughput Writes</h1>
<ul local-id=3D"ef038be7-b4ce-41b6-9924-8ad12bdedb7e">
<li local-id=3D"96b674a1-5a37-4082-a578-ee9b154a242a">
<p local-id=3D"076f8f495c3a">Alerts created per event =E2=86=92 distributed=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f07169f8-34be-479e-8e70-8bae0366e94e">
<p local-id=3D"ba7825ed9e89">No single partition bottleneck</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"84a75e681529" id=3D"AlertServiceTableDBdesign-Streams(Event=
-DrivenArchitecture)">Streams (Event-Driven Architecture)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"47281aece08b">Enable DynamoDB Streams for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7f9b9a9f-216c-4e1e-8f81-734c5f5e7871">
<li local-id=3D"0e64b305-8560-49e2-92f8-d1abe8298250">
<p local-id=3D"227b65e57f3b">Notification service</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7679611c-ffb6-4cc5-bcfe-fe6435d38abc">
<p local-id=3D"0e518ed49553">SLA breach detection</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dcfc4535-3bd6-4023-8cc2-c568bd3ee64c">
<p local-id=3D"d1d374c4b54b">Analytics pipeline</p></li>
</ul>
